  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《No Hostiles Around Campfire》是一款可配置的模組，能夠在可設定半徑內阻止營火周圍生成敵對生物。此模組也會防止被分類為<strong>「<em>EntityClassification/MobCategory.Monster</em>」</strong>的模組實體生成。當放置營火時，若營火周圍有敵對生物，模組將使其燃燒 30 秒，直至其死亡或營火被破壞。<br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:16px\">1.16 版本的<span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\">靈魂營火（Soul Campfire）</span>也相容！此功能可進行設定。</span></strong></span><br>您也可能對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/healing-campfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">治療營火（Healing Campfire）</a></strong></span> 感興趣。<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>部分實體可能未被分類為「怪物」，但仍會攻擊玩家。模組內建了一個自訂列表來包含這些特定實體。若您發現任何遺漏的實體，請透過問題追蹤器通知我，以便將其加入列表中。</em></span><br><strong>目前列表包含：</strong>Quark 模組的 FoxHound（狐犬）。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套裝\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventHostilesRadius</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 48，最小值 1，最大值 128</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">營火周圍以方塊為單位的半徑，在此範圍內將阻止敵對生物生成。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>burnHostilesAroundWhenPlaced&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;啟用後，每次玩家放置營火時，都會燒毀半徑範圍內的所有敵對生物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>burnHostilesRadiusModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.5，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;預設為 0.5。這表示如果半徑為 16，營火會燒毀半徑 8 範圍內的先前生物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventMobSpawnerSpawns</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;啟用後，當營火在半徑範圍內時，也會停用刷怪籠的生成。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeLit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，營火只有在被點燃時才會生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeSignalling</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，營火只有在處於信號狀態時才會生效。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>僅限 1.16+ 版本的設定選項：</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForNormalCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，模組將與普通營火一起運作。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForSoulCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，模組將與靈魂營火一起運作。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍托管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中，您即可在任何模組包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於評論分散在眾多不同的模組頁面上，難以追蹤，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
